---
pageKey: applications
---
{#- The call for applications, on its own URL. The selected groups live on the Soubory page; this
    page never lists them, it only says when the selection comes (in the call intro). Once the call
    closes, swap the two inMenu flags in content/pages.yaml – see the comment there.

    The head block holds the heading, the call's own heading and its intro in one column and the
    festival badge in the other, because the badge is drawn large enough to stand beside all three.
    Keeping them in one grid is what stops the badge from ever reaching the conditions below it. -#}
{%- set cc = db.copy.call -%}
{%- set callShown = edition.ageMin and edition.status == 'upcoming' -%}
<section class="wrap section page-head"{% if callShown %} id="call"{% endif %}>
  <div class="page-head-text">
    <h1>{{ registry.title | t(lang) }} {{ edition.year }}</h1>
    {%- if callShown %}
    <h2>{{ cc.heading | t(lang) }}</h2>
    <p class="lede call-intro">{{ cc.intro | t(lang) | fill({ n: edition.number | ordinal(lang), yearBefore: edition.year - 1 }) }}</p>
    {%- else %}
    <p class="lede call-intro">{{ cc.closed | t(lang) }}</p>
    {%- endif %}
  </div>
  <div class="page-head-logo" aria-hidden="true">
    <img src="/{{ edition.logo.color }}" alt="" width="809" height="809" fetchpriority="high">
  </div>
</section>
{% include "partials/call.njk" %}
